  "worked_solution": "Multiplying the matrices using the usual method, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =[\\begin{aligned}-1-\\text{i} & -\\text{i} \\\\ 3 & -2+\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1+\\text{i} & -3\\text{i} \\\\ -4-\\text{i} & 6\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}(-1-\\text{i})(1+\\text{i})+(-\\text{i})(-4-\\text{i}) & (-1-\\text{i})(-3\\text{i})+(-\\text{i})\\cdot 6 \\\\ 3\\cdot (1+\\text{i})+(-2+\\text{i})(-4-\\text{i}) & 3\\cdot (-3\\text{i})+(-2+\\text{i})\\cdot 6\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2\\text{i}+(4\\text{i}-1) & (3\\text{i}-3)+(-6\\text{i}) \\\\ (3+3\\text{i})+(9-2\\text{i}) & (-9\\text{i})+(-12+6\\text{i})\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1+2\\text{i} & -3-3\\text{i} \\\\ 12+\\text{i} & -12-3\\text{i}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
